    "media:imagetext": "257 Nanking Road\nShanghai, China\nNovember 28, 1939\nMr. H. H. Knight\n550 E. 87th St.\nNew York City\nU.S.A.\nDear Mr. Knight:\nWe are in receipt of a letter from\nMr. Bixby in which he said you had informed him that\nyou had paid the bill that we have against you for\nUS$271.80. Your check has not reached us and we\nwould be very pleased if you would send us another\none as the end of our year is near and we must re-\nOtherwise me will feel called upon\nto ask Mr. Polin (who approved the shipment) and Mr.\nBixby (who introduced and sponsored you to make\npayment.\nTrusting you will give this your\nearliest attention, we are\nYours truly,\nLAOU KAI FOOK COMPANY\nISI PJOs",
    "media:imagetext_created": 1787972035,
